  subgraph WS[Engineer workstation]
    World["Generated world engine<br/>Physics · devices · sensors"]:::workstation
    Raw["Complete workstation raw DI / AI<br/>BOOLs · native values · encoder counts"]:::workstation
    World --> Raw
  end

  subgraph PLC["PLC-side integration · CODESYS Control Win target"]
    Hardware["Hardware DI / AI<br/>Acquired raw image"]:::plc
    Select["Demo interceptor FB<br/>Normal: hardware by default<br/>Simulation: complete workstation image"]:::plc
    Logic["Existing PLC application<br/>Scaling · filtering · conditioning<br/>Sequence · control"]:::plc
    Tap["Authentic output command tap<br/>DO: live demo<br/>AO: Core compiled prototype"]:::plc
    Gate["Core compiled prototype: optional physical-sink gate<br/>Pass through by default"]:::prototype
    Outputs[Hardware DO / AO]:::plc
    Session["Session and diagnostics<br/>Boot identity · epoch/sequence<br/>Applied-image ack · freshness<br/>Link loss: hold last image + bench diagnostic"]:::evidence
    Hardware -->|Default raw image| Select
    Select -->|Selected raw values| Logic
    Logic --> Tap
    Tap --> Gate --> Outputs
    Session -.-> Select
  end
  Raw -->|Simulation mode| Select
  Tap -->|Authentic commands drive device response| World

  subgraph ECOSYSTEM["Reusable ecosystem · common semantics, platform-specific implementations"]
    Spec[Functional spec + I/O]:::workstation --> Contract["Versioned logical-signal contract + mapping<br/>Types · direction · configuration · provenance"]:::workstation
    Contract --> Adapter[Vendor adapter / library]:::prototype --> Runtime[ControlsBench connector / runtime]:::workstation
    Current["LIVE DEMO<br/>Integrated CODESYS interceptor FB<br/>OPC UA · qualified 10 Hz transport"]:::plc
    Library["COMPILED PROTOTYPE<br/>ControlsBench Core 0.2.0.0<br/>DI / AI / DO / AO + session / observation<br/>Not runtime-validated or deployed in demo"]:::prototype
    Future["FUTURE DIRECTIONS<br/>Other vendors · faster transports<br/>Acquisition / recording for PID and signal processing"]:::future
    Adapter -.-> Current
    Adapter -.-> Library
    Adapter -.-> Future
  end

  Prerequisite["Intentional integration requires an editable/rebuildable PLC project"]:::evidence
  Prerequisite -.-> Select
